    {
      "text": "redemption cometh in and through the Holy Messiah, 2 Ne. 2:6. if Christ had not come … could have been no redemption, Mosiah 16:6. redemption of the people … brought to pass through … Christ, Mosiah 18:2. wicked remain as though there had been no redemption, Alma 11:41. there was a plan of redemption laid, Alma 12:25 (22:13). no redemption for mankind save it were through … Christ, Alma 21:9. brought about the great and eternal plan of redemption, Alma 34:16. redemption … brought about, only on conditions of repentance, Alma 42:13. by me redemption cometh, 3 Ne. 9:17. I have come … to bring redemption unto the world, 3 Ne. 9:21. he hath brought to pass the redemption, Morm. 7:7. because of Jesus Christ came the redemption, Morm. 9:12. redemption cometh on all them that have no law, Moro. 8:22.",
