    {
      "text": "declare unto them repentance and redemption, D&C 29:42. sent mine Only Begotten Son into the world for the redemption, D&C 49:5. through the redemption … is brought to pass the resurrection, D&C 88:14. parable, that you may know … concerning the redemption, D&C 101:43 (103:15). keep the commandments … concerning the restoration and redemption of Zion, D&C 103:29. cannot escape the buffetings of Satan until the day of redemption, D&C 104:9. law be executed … after her redemption, D&C 105:34. sealed up unto the day of redemption, D&C 124:124. delivered unto … Satan unto the day of redemption, D&C 132:26. great atoning sacrifice that was made by the Son of God, for the redemption, D&C 138:2. awaiting … redemption from the bands of death, D&C 138:16. for the redemption of the dead, D&C 138:48 (138:54).",
